{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49499","headline":"虞美人 四 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧梧桐映纱窗晚，花谢莺声嬾。\n小屏屈曲掩青山，翠帏香粉玉炉寒，两蛾攒。\n颠狂年少轻离别，孤负春时节。\n画罗红袂有啼痕，魂销无语倚闺门，欲黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}